<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main id="main-content">
<section class="sh-page-hero" aria-label="Medical engineering"><div class="sh-container"><nav class="sh-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sh-breadcrumb__sep">/</span><span aria-current="page">Medical</span></nav><span class="sh-hero__tag">Industry / Medical</span><h1>Precision Components for Healthcare Applications</h1><p>Custom medical device components, diagnostic equipment housings, laboratory parts, and healthcare fixtures manufactured with precision and care.</p></div></section>
<section class="sh-section" aria-labelledby="overview-heading"><div class="sh-container"><div class="row align-items-center g-4 g-lg-5"><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="sh-section-title sh-section-title--left" style="max-width:680px;margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-6);"><span style="color:var(--sh-brand);font-size:var(--sh-text-xs);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;">Application Focus</span><h2 id="overview-heading" style="margin-top:var(--sh-space-3);">Precision where reliability matters.</h2><p>Healthcare components demand careful attention to geometry, fit, material choice, finish, and repeatability. We approach each brief around the intended use and manufacturing requirement.</p></div><div class="sh-grid sh-grid--2"><% ['Diagnostic equipment housings','Custom medical device components','Healthcare furniture and fixtures','Laboratory equipment parts','Prosthetic and assistive components'].forEach((item,index)=>{ %><div class="sh-flex" style="gap:var(--sh-space-3);align-items:flex-start;"><span style="color:var(--sh-brand);font-weight:800;">0<%= index+1 %></span><span class="sh-text-small"><%= item %></span></div><% }) %></div><div class="sh-flex sh-gap-4" style="margin-top:var(--sh-space-8);flex-wrap:wrap;"><a href="/request-quote" class="sh-btn sh-btn--primary">Get Medical Components</a><a href="/contact" class="sh-btn sh-btn--outline">Contact Us</a></div></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="sh-card" style="padding:var(--sh-space-2);overflow:hidden;"><img src="/img/medicine.jpeg" alt="Medical engineering" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" style="width:100%;height:420px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:var(--sh-radius-md);"></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="sh-section" style="background:var(--sh-surface-alt);" aria-labelledby="cap-heading"><div class="sh-container"><div class="sh-section-title"><span style="color:var(--sh-brand);font-size:var(--sh-text-xs);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;">Manufacturing Fit</span><h2 id="cap-heading" style="margin-top:var(--sh-space-3);">Capabilities for medical applications</h2><p>Process selection is driven by the component's geometry, material, volume, and required finish.</p></div><div class="sh-grid sh-grid--4"><% const caps=[['fa-solid fa-cube','3D Printing','Rapid prototypes and complex low-volume components.'],['fa-solid fa-bolt','Laser Cutting','Clean, precise profiles for housings, panels, and fixtures.'],['fa-solid fa-gears','CNC Punching','Repeatable sheet-metal features for equipment and enclosures.'],['fa-solid fa-fire-flame-curved','Plasma Cutting','Heavy fabrication for infrastructure and supporting components.']]; caps.forEach(c=>{ %><article class="sh-card sh-animate" style="height:100%;"><div class="sh-service__icon" style="background:var(--sh-brand);color:var(--sh-white);margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-5);"><i class="<%= c[0] %>" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h4><%= c[1] %></h4><p class="sh-text-small"><%= c[2] %></p></article><% }) %></div></div></section>
<section class="sh-section" aria-labelledby="process-heading"><div class="sh-container"><div class="sh-section-title sh-section-title--left" style="max-width:720px;"><span style="color:var(--sh-brand);font-size:var(--sh-text-xs);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;">Project Path</span><h2 id="process-heading" style="margin-top:var(--sh-space-3);">A controlled path from requirement to component.</h2></div><div class="sh-grid sh-grid--4"><% [['01','Brief','Understand the application, environment, fit, and performance requirement.'],['02','Engineer','Review geometry, material, tolerances, and manufacturing method.'],['03','Fabricate','Produce and inspect the component to the agreed specification.'],['04','Deliver','Package and deliver for integration, testing, or deployment.']].forEach(s=>{ %><article class="sh-card sh-animate"><strong style="color:var(--sh-brand);font-size:var(--sh-text-3xl);"><%= s[0] %></strong><h4 style="font-size:var(--sh-text-lg);margin-top:var(--sh-space-4);"><%= s[1] %></h4><p class="sh-text-small"><%= s[2] %></p></article><% }) %></div></div></section>
<%- include('partials/cta-section') %>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %><%- include('partials/scripts') %>